## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime Whisper
- **Short description:** OpenAI's streaming speech-to-text model for low-latency live transcription with tunable latency/accuracy tradeoff.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Realtime transcription endpoint `v1/realtime/transcription_sessions`, model ID `gpt-realtime-whisper` (dedicated endpoint only; Realtime, Chat Completions, and Responses not supported).
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not disclosed in fetched sources; knowledge cutoff 2026-09-30 (OpenAI docs)
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-realtime-whisper`
- **Context window:** 16,000 total with 2,000 max output (OpenAI docs)
- **Modalities:** Audio and text in; text out; streaming yes; no reasoning, tool-call, or image support listed
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-29):** $0.017 per audio minute (OpenAI docs; priced by duration, not tokens)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (no params, license, or weights disclosed)

